WEBVTT

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.710
The Kouka Revue was
founded in the Taisho era

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:25.500
by Ooizumi Minoru, part of a group of
big-name companies in Kobe.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.630
The all-female acting troupe was
comprised of young, unmarried women.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.920
"The Rose of Versailles"

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.060
Their extravagant productions
stole the hearts of thousands.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.640
None moreso than their
<i>otoko-yaku </i>actresses,

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.770
who were said to be more
gentlemanly than 'real' men,

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:44.820
and earned the troupe
huge swaths of female fans.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:48.940
Years later, they established a school
to train the troupe's next big stars,

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:52.660
the Kouka School of
Musical and Theatrical Arts.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:56.240
Its admittance rate is
as low as Tokyo University,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.290
with only the most lovely and
talented actresses offered admission.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.090
Beneath the Cherry Tree, in a Rain of Petals

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.090
Beneath the Cherry Tree, in a Rain of Petals

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.010
Excuse me, are you...

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.230
Naracchi?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.950
You're Naracchi from JPX, right?!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:47.960
Oh, sorry to bother you!
I'm just such a <i>huge </i>Naracchi stan!

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.500
I'm so sorry they made you
graduate like that,

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.630
but I really hope you'll
keep giving it your all!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:59.800
I'll stan you forever, Naracchi!
I can't wait to see what you do next!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.640
No! I'm scared! Someone, help!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.430
Ai?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.770
Taichi!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.860
Ai? What happened?

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:19.610
A male fan touched my shoulder.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.860
Oh.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.740
Don't worry, he didn't follow you.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.910
Here. This showed up at my sister's place.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.960
It's your results from the first round
of Kouka admissions.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.330
"Congratulations! You've passed
the first round of admissions!"

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.380
What'd they say?

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.760
I made it through.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:42.140
I just need to pass the next one and
I'll have two whole years without men.

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:47.890
There are teachers at school, too.
Male teachers, like me.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.440
You're different, Taichi.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:53.900
I know. C'mon, let's go home.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:07.490
I hear Sarasa-<i>chan </i>made it past
the first round for Kouka! Good for her!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:15.920
Watanabe
 Tatami

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.410
Kouka's that acting troupe, right?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.870
Where they do all that
singing and dancing?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.250
Of course she'd make it! Apple doesn't
fall far from the tree, after all.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:18.630
Honey! Don't go mentioning that
in front of Grandpa Ken, now!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:19.760
Why not?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.800
Kouka and kabuki both start with K,

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.260
but they ain't the same!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.260
Idiot!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.050
That don't make it all right!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:28.680
Grandpa Ken doesn't want to
hear any of those actin' words!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.600
F-Fine, fine!

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.350
Huh? What's this ruckus about?

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:39.440
Grandpa Ken! We heard your Sarasa-<i>chan</i>
got past the first round for Kouka!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.610
Congratulations!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:47.580
Is that why you're all here,
to celebrate? Well, thanks!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.120
Why don't y'all come in?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.500
Hey, Sarasa!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.960
I don't think Sarasa-<i>chan</i>'s here.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.500
She's not? Sarasa!

