00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:07.930
{=3}Watanabe Family

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:11.730
I was lucky enough to be born a girl,
so I'm gonna give it everything I've got!

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:17.730
Here we are at the Kouka School
of Musical and Theatrical Arts,

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.350
KSMTA
Second
Round
Auditions

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.780
now in its centennial year,

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:24.280
and here we have the hopeful applicants
for its historic hundredth class.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.990
How many applicants did we get this year?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:33.040
1,135 applicants. These girls
would be the top 200.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.790
Pretty crazy, huh?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.920
Only 40 will be offered admission.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:41.840
And they're all here
an hour early. Good for them!

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:46.550
They've got no clue about the nightmare
waiting for them after they get in.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.760
There's Miyuki Hakuho! She was
a <i>musume-yaku </i>in the Flower Troupe.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:54.310
That'll be her daughter,
then: Kaoru Hoshino.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.730
If she gets in, that'll make three
straight generations of Kouka actresses.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.980
She got passed over for admission
the last two years, though.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.530
She might be a thoroughbred Kouka actress,
but that doesn't mean she's in.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.660
She can hear us up here, y'know.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.910
Did you see that intense glare?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.950
Look, there's Sawa Sugimoto.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.250
She's the Kouka Revue nerd
who got the top score in the first round.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:23.050
Yep. She's won awards performing in
her internationally famous ballet troupe.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.930
Ditching prima ballerina for
Kouka actress, then? What a weirdo.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.890
Whoa, what the heck?
There's two of the same girl.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.100
'Cause they're twins, right?

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.390
Oh, is that right?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:39.980
I was wondering why the same girl
was taking the test twice!

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:43.230
Let's get serious now, Narata-<i>sensei</i>.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.860
S-Sorry! Excuse me.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.780
Doesn't <i>she </i>look normal.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.120
She's a normally <i>talented </i>Kouka applicant.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.910
Speaking of normal,
I don't see our favorite weirdo.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.370
Oh, <i>her</i>. The one you <i>wouldn't</i>
think was an applicant.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.000
Yep. Super out of the ordinary.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.300
Bet she didn't make it
past the first round.

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:12.390
Look, that's Ai Narata, ex-JPX idol!

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:13.310
Whatever.

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:15.100
She got canceled online

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:18.230
after she told a fan he was
"creepy" straight to his face.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.400
That's why they made her 'graduate' early.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.400
Whatever.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.360
And now she's going
for Kouka? That's so wrong.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.610
Whatever.

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:28.400
I don't care what anyone says about me.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.820
Applicant Ticket: Ai Narata

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:36.700
I've trained myself not to feel anything.
This doesn't bother me.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:46.590
Your cute niece is getting real close
to the Kouka cherry tree.

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:47.670
What?!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.640
No! Get away from that tree, Ai!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.390
You didn't tell her about
the cherry tree curse?

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.940
It's beautiful.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.650
Are you alone, too?

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:10.490
How is it that you have such beauty,
yet no one wants to bask in it?

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.170
Excuse me!

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:24.670
Can I get a picture?!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:40.640
Her arms and legs were long and lithe,
like a graceful gazelle.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.940
Her eyes were sparkling and full of stars.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:46.440
And she was so terrifyingly...

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:50.860
Hello! I'm Sarasa Watanabe, and I'm 15!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.780
You're tall.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:57.740
Yep!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.750
Is that your applicant ticket?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.210
I'll get it for you!

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:12.840
Huh?!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.300
She floated!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:19.640
No, she jumped without using her knees,
straight up, from a standing position!

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:25.100
She landed in the exact same place, too.
Her core strength must be insane!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.400
Here you go!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.980
You can thank me by
taking my picture! Here.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.490
Huh? What?

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:34.740
Oh, the camera's this app here.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:38.200
Wait, I'm-- I'm taking a picture? Of you?

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.700
Yeah! I wanna get
the cherry tree behind me.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.120
Grandpa Ken had work today,
so he couldn't come,

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.250
but I wanna show him pictures later!

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:51.630
I can't believe it. How do they not know?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.680
"If you stand beneath the Kouka
cherry tree before you're admitted,

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:59.300
you will never, ever,
be a Kouka top star."

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.430
Take one from this angle next!

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:02.470
Huh?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.400
Now do one from over here!

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.060
Another?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:14.360
This was how I, Ai Narata,
met Sarasa Watanabe.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:18.030
Congrats for making it into Kouka!

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.580
How did <i>she </i>make it in?

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.290
Wait, who?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:29.500
Sarasa. Sarasa Something.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:36.720
We will now present
the admission results

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:42.470
for the 100th class of the Kouka School
for Musical and Theatrical Arts!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:43.430
Admitted Students

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.180
Admitted Students

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:52.150
Of course I got in.
A rotten fish is still a fish.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:54.490
But how did <i>she </i>get in?

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.650
Congratulations on your admittance.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.410
I'm Vice Principal Haruhiko Oizumi.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:05.580
Let's talk about your
next steps after admission.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.580
Everyone's avoiding me.
They won't even sit next to me.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:12.710
I'm so sorry! My phone call
with Grandpa Ken took <i>forever</i>!

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.220
Is this seat taken?

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:21.470
Why would you intentionally sit
next to me? And be so loud about it?!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.970
Oh, you took my picture
with the cherry tree!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:24.930
The cherry tree?

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.180
So you made it in, too!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:31.360
She didn't recognize Naracchi?
Here I thought everyone knew the JPX48.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:34.650
Maybe she doesn't have a TV.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:35.650
Or maybe...

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.320
She's doing it on purpose!

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.030
She's gonna hear you!

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:43.200
I totally forgot to
ask your name back then!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.120
What is it?

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.790
I hope we can be friends!

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.790
Excuse me, you two, please be quiet.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.000
<i>You two?!</i>

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.960
How the hell did <i>she </i>get in?

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:56.380
First off, you're <i>not </i>rotten, Ai.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.630
And this is interesting. You usually don't
take this much interest in others.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.640
I'm <i>not </i>interested in her.

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:05.430
Sarasa Watanabe was admitted on
the recommendations of two teachers:

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:09.060
Andou-<i>sensei</i>, the acting teacher;
and Ohki-<i>sensei</i>, the history teacher.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:14.270
She's not what we'd usually admit, sure.
But this is our centennial year!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.480
Let's get creative, be a little daring!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:21.780
She barely knows any ballet, and her
singing voice is hardly Kouka material,

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.120
but between her incredible height
and her utter fearlessness,

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.410
we might be able to make her into a star!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:31.500
Number 0251, Sarasa Watanabe!

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.460
Thanks for having me today!

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:36.840
Her fearlessness?

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.340
You "got creative" and
"want to make her a star"?

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.180
Hey, don't play with your food.

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:45.260
She's from Asakusa and
lives with her grandfather.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.970
She wasn't born in the lap of luxury.

