00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.930
Oh, I think I saw you on TV--

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:10.760
Right, I shouldn't mention
any of that. Sorry, honey.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.640
First-year students are on the third
and fourth floors of Dorm #2.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.770
You'll be in a double in room 302.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.570
Thank you, ma'am.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:24.780
There's no stench of men. I love it.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:28.700
Today I begin my nice, relaxing life.

